  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "First of all we draw the graph $y=x^{3}, y=\\frac{1}{x}, x=2$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_mat_a70.png\">\r\n\r\nRequired area i.e., (OMPNO) $=\\int_{0}^{1} x^{3} d x+\\int_{1}^{2} \\frac{1}{x} d x$\r\n$=\\left[\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right]_{0}+\\left[\\log _{4} x\\right]_{1}^{2}=\\frac{1}{4}+\\log _{c} 2$",
    "image": null
